  "body": "Filing this as a follow-up for https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/4048/files#r249254359. Might be worth factoring out some of the identical request-managing steps that appear in:\r\n - link rel=preload's fetch and process the linked resource algorithm\r\n - [default fetch and process the linked resource algorithm](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#default-fetch-and-process-the-linked-resource)\r\n\r\nIt's not major duplication, but seems like a candidate for refactoring.",
